        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In cases where the OTS Installer has the required U.S. Government clearance and is not Skill Plan qualified in Data Networking or Maintenance Operations, or is not a Lucent Certified Internetworking Expert-Associate (LCIE) or Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA), then Core Installers with more than 10 years service and like skills will be considered based on seniority.",
